					"enumDescriptions": [
						"Follow the editor. The display language stays whatever argv.json says; this extension only offers to change it once.",
						"中文（简体） (Chinese Simplified) — workbench and Cursor UI. Pack stays installed.",
						"中文（繁體） (Chinese Traditional) — workbench and Cursor UI. Pack stays installed.",
						"English (built-in). Workbench and Cursor UI all return to English. The pack stays installed — switch back anytime without reinstalling."
					],
					"default": "auto",
					"markdownDescription": "Display language for the Cursor interface (editor chrome **and** Cursor-authored workbench strings).\n\nChanging this writes only the `locale` field of `argv.json` and offers to restart. It does **not** uninstall the extension — translations stay on disk, so you can switch Chinese ↔ English repeatedly without reinstalling.\n\nTo remove the pack entirely: uninstall the extension, then set this to `en` (or delete `locale` in `argv.json`) and restart.",
